   "section": "au-banner",
   "items": [
    {
     "role": "heading",
     "order": 0,
     "text": "A Bank You Can Call Your ‘Own’"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 1,
     "text": "Founded in the pre-independence era in 1943, we have partnered India for over 80 years."
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 2,
     "text": "With our tailored product suite & loan solutions, we want to partner our customers’ journey and become their banking partner for life."
    }
   ],
   "imgCount": 0,
   "editableTexts": 3,
   "repeats": []
  },
  {
   "section": "au-about",
   "items": [
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 0,
     "text": "About Us",
     "href": "/about-us"
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 1,
     "text": "Board of Directors",
     "href": "/about-us/board-of-directors"
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 2,
     "text": "Leadership Team",
     "href": "/about-us/leadership-team"
    },
    {
     "role": "heading",
     "order": 3,
     "text": "About RBL Bank"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 4,
     "text": "RBL Bank, a subsidiary of Emirates NBD Bank P.J.S.C., is one of India’s leading private sector banks, with a legacy dating back to 1943."
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 5,
     "text": "Headquartered in Mumbai, the Bank has evolved into a dynamic financial institution offering a comprehensive suite of banking products and services catering to wide range of individual customer segments; small and medium enterprises, large corporations, and governments with a full range of banking, investment management, trade and other financial solutions. The Bank has a strong digital offering with sizeable operation under digital payments space."
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 6,
     "text": "With a strong focus on innovation, customer-centricity, and digital transformation, RBL Bank serves over 15 million customers through a robust network of 628 branches, 1,326 business correspondent branches (of which 248 banking outlets) spread across 28 Indian states and union territories."
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 7,
     "text": "RBL Bank is committed to being a ‘Bank of Choice’ by fostering enduring relationships built on trust, transparency, and responsiveness. Backed by a strong capital base, endorsed with an International Baa2 rating by Moody’s Ratings, a first one to be assigned to any Bank in India, and reinforced with a long-term credit rating of AAA Stable by Crisil, ICRA and CARE Ratings; it continues to strengthen stakeholder confidence. RBL Bank drives financial inclusion, and supports community development through impactful CSR initiatives, and creates a thriving workplace culture for its employees."
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 8,
     "text": "RBL Bank is listed on both NSE and BSE (RBLBANK)."
    }
   ],
