  {
   "section": "au-values",
   "items": [
    {
     "role": "heading",
     "order": 0,
     "text": "Our Vision"
    },
    {
     "role": "heading",
     "order": 1,
     "text": "Bank of Choice"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 2,
     "text": "To be a 'Bank of Choice' by creating and nurturing enduring relationships through trust and respect of our customers, employees and partners."
    },
    {
     "role": "heading",
     "order": 3,
     "text": "Trust and Respect of our Stakeholders"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 4,
     "text": "To engage and ensure that all our stakeholders commitments are fulfilled, while working as a team."
    },
    {
     "role": "heading",
     "order": 5,
     "text": "Creating and Nurturing Enduring Relationships"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 6,
     "text": "To create and build lasting partnership with all our customers based on full disclosure and transparency."
    },
    {
     "role": "heading",
     "order": 7,
     "text": "Our Mission"
    },
    {
     "role": "heading",
     "order": 8,
     "text": "CUSTOMERS AT THE HEART"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 9,
     "text": "To engage and understand customer needs, provide best-in-class products & services, be responsive and quick in resolving queries - resulting in true customer delight & peace of mind."
    },
    {
     "role": "heading",
     "order": 10,
     "text": "EMPLOYEES AS THE PILLAR"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 11,
     "text": "To provide an enabling work culture, where career aspirations can be realized through consistent performance and demonstration of the Bank’s core values & beliefs."
    },
    {
     "role": "heading",
     "order": 12,
     "text": "COMMUNITY AS THE CAUSE"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 13,
     "text": "To deliver robust and cost-effective banking services that promote financial inclusion, catalyse growth and reduce social inequalities."
    },
    {
     "role": "heading",
     "order": 14,
     "text": "SHAREHOLDER VALUE AS THE FOCUS"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 15,
     "text": "To demonstrate high corporate governance standards that protects and balances stakeholder interests in the journey to achieving short and long term business goals."
    },
    {
     "role": "heading",
     "order": 16,
     "text": "CSR Activities"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 17,
     "text": "At RBL Bank, we have always believed in bringing real change in the society through our CSR initiatives under Health, Education and Livelihood Opportunities. We are grateful for the unwavering support and contributions of our partners, NGOs, customers and employees, for helping us consistently deliver on our mission pillar of 'Community as the Cause'."
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 18,
     "text": "Explore More",
     "href": "/social-responsibility"
    },
    {
     "role": "heading",
     "order": 19,
     "text": "Careers at RBL Bank"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 20,
     "text": "Guided by the mission of 'Employees as the Pillar' and PREET values (Professionalism, Respect, Excellence, Entrepreneurial, Teamwork), we at RBL Bank constantly strive to be an organization that provides an equal, healthy and flourishing environment for its employees to grow with."
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 21,
     "text": "Explore More",
     "href": "/careers"
    }
   ],
